  "description": "A modern UptimeRobot.com API client for .NET with full API coverage, pagination support, and nullable reference types. Supports .NET 9.0, .NET 8.0, .NET 6.0, and .NET Standard 2.0. Version 2.0 includes breaking changes from v1.x - see migration guide in CHANGELOG.md.",
